# How to Issue and Return Books

## Introduction
How a librarian issues and returns
books in the Library System.

## Issuing a Book
1. Search the book by title or ID.
2. Confirm the book is available.
3. Enter member ID, click Issue.
4. Issue and due dates are saved.

## Returning a Book
1. Enter the book ID or member ID.
2. Click Return.
3. Availability is updated and any
   late fine is calculated.

## Conclusion
These steps keep records accurate.
